alues are moved from, rather than copied from.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Nested_types\">Nested types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-until-cxx20\"><td>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Type\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>iterator_type</code>\n</td>\n<td> <code>Iter</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>iterator_category</code>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/iterator_traits\"><span class=\"kw656\">std::<span class=\"me2\">iterator_traits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Iter<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">iterator_category</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>value_type</code>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/iterator_traits\"><span class=\"kw656\">std::<span class=\"me2\">iterator_traits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Iter<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">value_type</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>difference_type</code>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/iterator_traits\"><span class=\"kw656\">std::<span class=\"me2\">iterator_traits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Iter<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">difference_type</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>pointer</code>\n</td>\n<td> <code>Iter</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>reference</code>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li> the rvalue reference version of <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/iterator_traits\"><span class=\"kw656\">std::<span class=\"me2\">iterator_traits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Iter<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span